Body: <p>I am trying access <code>kibana</code> application deployed in <code>nginx</code>,but getting below </p>

<p>URL :- <code>http://127.0.0.1/kibana-3.1.2</code></p>

<pre><code>2015/02/01 23:05:05 [alert] 3919#0: *766 768 worker_connections are not enough while connecting to upstream, client: 127.0.0.1, server: , request: "GET /kibana-3.1.2 HTTP/1.0", upstream: "http://127.0.0.1:80/kibana-3.1.2", host: "127.0.0.1"
</code></pre>

<p>Kibana is deployed at <code>/var/www/kibana-3.1.2</code></p>

